105930-6f1a-4b6c-b1a7-b30fe8a474f1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"c8811b6fb7cf9cb8d0461a2af9670e521f22233f584db638ac46a701263a4078","event_uuid":"dfe7ee57-d5df-4b13-9359-9f3a515a9d9a","position":{"commit_sha":"3b76fb2dbc856d466c83026cc2f22a3fe9d156e2","position":"1787612811206383536-dfe7ee57-d5df-4b13-9359-9f3a515a9d9a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787028064503928001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"6b2fb6c7-5267-40ad-b7e8-e1cfa2dcad19","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"0ad4-9f1c-09f6-4760"},{"link_uuid":"968a0725-e626-4f6a-acf5-b119059335cb","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"b4b8-12a2-5c60-4d5e"},{"link_uuid":"0aeef9d1-bd1a-4df9-8b9c-9d47ce066b67","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"afb2-fe72-23db-4b7d"},{"link_uuid":"a3105930-6f1a-4b6c-b1a7-b30fe8a474f1","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"bd1e-c904-fd20-4d7f"},{"link_uuid":"dfe7ee57-d5df-4b13-9359-9f3a515a9d9a","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"8150-c47b-e558-4be0"}],"description":"## Context\nPure mutation plans still need to represent binding lifecycle decisions and prerequisite ordering without performing effects. Selection, filters, mode caps, and safety limits must exclude work before intents are eligible.\n\n## Outcome\nAdd versioned lifecycle intents and explicit inter-ticket dependencies to `TicketPlan`, and apply every global selection/limit before any lifecycle or remote effect.\n\n## Plan\n1. Model bind, confirm, re-key, retire, baseline, and comment-identity changes as versioned intents only. Each intent's `version` is the enclosing frozen `Observation.version` identity from S2 T1 (its `ObservationVersion` — the content-hash `fingerprint` plus `pass_id`); intents carry no independent counter, so pure oracle tables assert `intent.version == observation.version` exactly.\n2. Encode create-before-link and parent-before-child prerequisites. A blocked prerequisite yields a deferred disposition carrying reason `dependency_deferred` and emits no out-of-order mutation.\n3. Move selection, filter, mode cap, and global safety limit decisions into pre-effect planning, each recording a distinguishable deferral reason (see \"Dispositions\" below).\n4. Cover tombstones, pending/index lag, moved keys, impossible links, partial snapshots, and filtered passes with ticket-sourced tables, each mapping to a deterministic disposition + reason.\n\n## Dispositions (deferral reason vocabulary)\n`PlanDisposition` keeps `mutate`/`defer`/`noop`; a deferred/excluded plan additionally records a `defer_reason` drawn from the existing apply-layer `operation_outcome.Disposition` names, so each AC outcome family is separately assertable:\n- blocked prerequisite (create-before-link / parent-before-child) -> `dependency_deferred`\n- selection / filter exclusion -> `scope_deferred`\n- mode cap / global safety limit exclusion -> `safety_aborted`\n- tombstone / index-lag / moved-key / impossible-link / partial-snapshot -> `skipped`\n\n## Impacted sites (existing construction/consumer surface)\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/ticket_plan.py` — `TicketPlan` value type: gains versioned lifecycle-intent and inter-ticket-dependency fields plus the `defer_reason` field (kept frozen, provider-neutral, open payload).\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/ticket_planner.py` — `plan_pass` (currently groups mutations by target only, ticket_planner.py:110-126): gains intent/dependency derivation and pre-effect selection/filter/mode-cap/limit exclusion with reason tagging. Stays pure (zero I/O).\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/run_differs.py:285` — the shadow construction site `ctx.observation, ctx.ticket_plans = ticket_planner.plan_pass(... selection=..., limits=..., mode=...)`. **In scope:** it adopts the new pre-effect selection/filter/mode-cap/limit behavior and the widened `TicketPlan` surface by calling the updated `plan_pass`; it already forwards `selection`/`limits`/`mode`, so any `plan_pass` signature change is reflected at this call site. It remains a pure, additive shadow attach performing no effects.\n- `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_ticket_plan_shadow.py` — held-out oracle extended for intents/dependencies/pre-effect exclusion.\n\n## Testing\nPure tables assert exact intent values (including `version == observation.version`), dependency edges, and per-family `(disposition, defer_reason)` pairs, and poison repository/provider writes. Ordering tests vary each limit independently.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every named binding change is represented as a lifecycle intent whose `version` equals the enclosing `Observation.version` identity.\n- [ ] No lifecycle intent performs any write during planning (all repository/provider write seams poisoned).\n- [ ] Create-before-link prerequisites are explicit plan dependencies.\n- [ ] Parent-before-child prerequisites are explicit plan dependencies.\n- [ ] Blocked prerequisites produce deferred plans tagged `dependency_deferred`.\n- [ ] Blocked prerequisites emit no out-of-order mutation.\n- [ ] Selection and filter exclusion produce plans tagged `scope_deferred` before any intent or remote effect is eligible.\n- [ ] Mode cap and global safety limit exclusion produce plans tagged `safety_aborted` before any intent or remote effect is eligible.\n- [ ] Ticket-sourced tombstone, index-lag, move, impossible-link, and partial-snapshot cases produce deterministic `skipped` dispositions.\n\n## Out of scope\nPreview output rendering and production coordinator execution. The `run_differs.py:285` shadow construction site is in scope only for adopting the updated `plan_pass` signature/semantics (above); it does not gain preview rendering or effectful execution.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/ticket_plan.py","reason":"add versioned lifecycle-intent and inter-ticket-dependency fields to TicketPlan"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/ticket_planner.py","reason":"plan_pass gains intent/dependency derivation + pre-effect selection/filter/mode-cap/limit exclusion"},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/run_differs.py","reason":"shadow plan_pass call site adopts updated signature/semantics"},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_ticket_plan_shadow.py","reason":"held-out oracle extended for intents/dependencies/pre-effect exclusion"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["depends_on","0ad4-9f1c-09f6-4760"],["parent","f828-6f5e-3b15-41f5"],["relates_to","8150-c47b-e558-4be0"],["relates_to","afb2-fe72-23db-4b7d"],["relates_to","b4b8-12a2-5c60-4d5e"],["relates_to","bd1e-c904-fd20-4d7f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"f828-6f5e-3b15-41f5","parent_status_uuid":"3648a996-c6c6-4174-a400-892513bf5237","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["rp03","planner","tdd"],"ticket_id":"85f8-de1a-e425-4584","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-03 S2 T2 — Plan lifecycle intents, dependencies, and pre-effect limits","verify_commands":[{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_ticket_plan_shadow.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_mode_cap_enforcement.py","dd_id":"AC1-AC5","dd_text":"Lifecycle intents, dependencies, deferral, pre-effect limits, and ticket-sourced cases"}]},"source_event_uuids":["55a88451-8132-4d96-b1c0-630edef1d069","0c6a84c0-c77d-43a4-86c0-b5b7095d8e9c","c3874280-24b0-4956-b99f-aff44c5f8015","25df98c2-ffd0-47c7-9139-ce4c158ff4c0","4a715927-1789-47ba-9169-9d33621edcba","3648a996-c6c6-4174-a400-892513bf5237","f267c886-1c0d-4f62-9f74-fc45f006adc7","968a0725-e626-4f6a-acf5-b119059335cb","0aeef9d1-bd1a-4df9-8b9c-9d47ce066b67","a3105930-6f1a-4b6c-b1a7-b30fe8a474f1","dfe7ee57-d5df-4b13-9359-9f3a515a9d9a"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787612811206383537,"uuid":"e8540c9e-9a09-47cc-8cbf-f72d55df7a3c"}